absurdly effective: Chi Strike: Elemental Fist: Pummel: Ground Slam:
Keep beating it until it dies. With Chi Strike/Fist still on, it
shouldn't take very long.

I did this to MAster Kaen once at XL9, with no MR, no reflection, and
not much armor, and killed him on the ground slam. I did have speed
boots. It went like this:
Me: Chi Strike
MK: Miss
Me: Elemental Fist
Me: Pummel
MK: Miss
Me: Ground Slam
MK: Dies.
I lost zero HP. Of course, then I nearly died to all the
xorns/elementals...
Maybe I was lucky, but that sequence appears to work very nicely on
separate turns. For Chain Blitz, I tried many times to do CS-EF-P, and
